BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Turtle Time\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260604T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260604T113000
UID:c90c7ede1813f89ac3c732dccdc31fcd@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Come see an eastern box turtle as we feed it! Learn about the 
 unique adaptations these creatures have\, what issues they face\, and how 
 you can help their wild populations! If the weather is nice\, we will be o
 n the lawn outside the Nature Center. Otherwise\, we will be inside.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Nature Center\, 1405 S.R. 46 W\, Nashvi
 lle\, IN 
URL:https://on.in.gov/BrownCountySP
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
END:VEVENT
