DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260616T093000
UID:55eb96ad4867fe3674af0fa53fe73738@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Join a park naturalist for a short walk along Salt Creek! The 
 north side of the park lies in the Salt Creek Valley. Learn the history of
  that part of the park and look for wildlife and plants that aren&#39\;t f
 ound in the dry\, forested hills.&nbsp\; Meet at the Olympic Pool. The Sal
 t Creek Trail is about 1.5 miles out and back and considered very easy. Af
 ter crossing a short lawn\, the trail is ADA accessible.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Olympic Pool\, 1405 S.R. 46 W\, Nashvil
 le\, IN 
URL:on.in.gov/BrownCountySP
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
END:VEVENT
